From 0cfc48b0e374d7e84c122f739182a39feea56d46 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xiake Sun <xiake.sun@amd.com>
Date: Fri, 31 Jul 2026 01:49:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(MHA): Route MiMo cached prefill directly to AITER
 page-64 attention

- Build ragged page metadata for MiMo cached-prefill batches and pass the vectorized 5D FP8 KV cache directly to AITER for tuned CK FP8 mha batch prefill 16Q/1KV, head-192, page-64 configuration.
- This avoids the expensive KV gather-and-linearize path while retaining existing BF16 fresh-prefill and SWA/sink/unsupported-shape fallbacks.
- Required related AITER CK dependency update.

Signed-off-by: Xiake Sun <xiake.sun@amd.com>
---
